SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT grant below covers this repository: the mod that ships to a player, and
the tooling and documentation that build and explain it.

    src/       the REDscript, the CET window, the icon archive, the read-me
    plugin/    the RED4ext plugin sources for ai_npc.dll
    fomod/     the installer read by Vortex and MO2
    source/    raw asset sources for the icon archive
    tools/     packager, linters, offline checks, prompt regression suite
    docs/      the written documentation

Two things it cannot cover, and does not:

vendor/ is a git submodule. It is somebody else's work under its own licence, and
nothing here grants any right over it.

Cyberpunk 2077 and everything belonging to CD PROJEKT S.A. are not covered by any
grant made here. NOTICE.md states what that means in practice, and the conditions
CD PROJEKT RED imposes on top of this licence — non-commercial distribution, in
particular. Read it before redistributing.

